# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Optional Skills State
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Skills now live at ``<repo>/installer/bundled-skills/`` and
# ``<repo>/installer/optional-skills/`` for the bundled source. The hub
# state is written under the runtime install location (``~/.spiritagent/skills/``,
# ``~/.spiritagent/optional-skills/``) so these ignores apply wherever the
# patterns appear.
**/skills/.hub/
**/ignored/
**/optional-skills/.hub/

